---
alwaysApply: true
---

Desktop, tablet, and mobile are treated as separate protected experiences.

When asked to modify one breakpoint:
- Preserve the appearance and behavior of the others.
- Reuse the existing breakpoint system.
- Avoid changes to shared styles unless necessary.
- If shared styles must be modified, ensure all non-target breakpoints render identically afterward.
- Verify that no regressions occur outside the target breakpoint.
